i>\n                  <li>Intel® 2.5Gbps LAN</li>\n                  <li>Intel Wi-Fi 6E Supports 802.11 a/ b/ g/ n/ ac/ ax and Bluetooth 5.3</li>\n                  <li>Realtek® ALC4080 Codec; 7.1-Channel USB High Performance Audio</li>\n                  <li>ATX Form Factor for wide case Compatibility</li>\n                  <li>2-Year Limited Warranty</li>\n              </ul>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"block-footer\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View Details</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n                    </div>\n</div>\n\n                  </div>\n                              </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <p data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"594\"><strong data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"268\">MSI PRO Z790-A WIFI DDR5 ATX Motherboard</strong> is engineered for professional creators and gamers using Intel’s latest 14th, 13th, and 12th Gen Core processors. Powered by the high-performance <strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"437\">Intel Z790 chipset</strong> and <strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"461\">LGA 1700 socket</strong>, it supports <strong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"511\">DDR5 memory up to 7200+ MHz (OC)</strong>, ensuring blazing-fast performance for multitasking, content creation, and gaming.</p>\n<p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"939\">Equipped with <strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"631\">4× M.2 Gen4 slots</strong>, <strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"650\">6× SATA ports</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"672\">PCIe 5.0 x16</strong>, this motherboard delivers ultra-fast data transfer and broad expandability for NVMe SSDs and high-end GPUs. Built-in <strong data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"803\">Wi-Fi 6E</strong>, <strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"817\">2.5G LAN</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"840\">Bluetooth 5.3</strong> provide seamless connectivity, while USB 3.2 Gen 2x2 Type-C ensures high-speed peripheral support.</p><p><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1223\"><strong data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1223\">Key Features:&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1638\"><li data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1279\">\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1279\">Supports <strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1279\">Intel 14th/13th/12th Gen CPUs (LGA1700)</strong></p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1326\">\n<p data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1326\"><strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1294\">DDR5 RAM</strong> up to 7200+ MHz (OC), 128GB Max</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1378\">\n<p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1378\"><strong data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1345\">4x M.2 slots</strong> with PCIe Gen4 x4, 6x SATA 6Gb/s</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1427\">\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1427\"><strong data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1402\">PCIe 5.0 x16 slot</strong> for next-gen GPU support</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1488\">\n<p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1488\"><strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1448\">Intel Wi-Fi 6E</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1465\">2.5Gbps LAN</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1488\">Bluetooth 5.3</strong></p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1536\">\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1536\"><strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1517\">USB 3.2 Gen 2x2 Type-C</strong>, HDMI, DisplayPort</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1588\">\n<p data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1588\">Advanced thermal solution with extended heatsinks</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1638\"><p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1638\"><strong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1610\">ATX Form Factor</strong> for wide case compatibility</p></li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-t